    group pageD members ["tv","d_ya","d_ty"] hidden true

    card title "I love it"

A: Мне нра́вится says I like it. But how do you say in Russian that you love something?
    draw speakers heart

    hide speakers

    move heart to.x 500 to.y 620 scale 0.7 duration 0.6

B: With one verb: я люблю́. Я люблю́ ма́му, I love mum.
    draw r_mum s_mum

A: Hear the end of ма́му? The thing you love takes the object ending from lesson fourteen, just as in я ви́жу ма́му.
    highlight s_mum color #c9871a part у$ effect underline

B: The same with my cat: я люблю́ ко́шку.
    draw r_cat s_cat

    highlight s_cat color #c9871a part у$ effect underline duration 0.8

A: But суп ends like он, so it stays as it is: я люблю́ суп.
    draw r_tea s_tea

    highlight s_tea color #c9871a part суп effect underline duration 0.8

    erase rows heart

B: So what's the difference from мне нра́вится ко́фе?
    draw b_tea b_like b_like_g b_love b_love_g

A: With нра́вится, the coffee does the pleasing, and I simply like it.
    highlight b_like color #c9871a

A: With люблю́, I do the loving, and it's stronger: I love coffee.
    highlight b_love color #c9871a

    erase pageB

A: Now the whole verb. You met four of говори́ть's forms in lesson seven, and люби́ть shares its endings.
    draw h_gov h_lub p_ya p_ty p_on p_my p_vy p_oni

B: Я говорю́, я люблю́: both end in ю.
    draw g_ya l_ya

    hide l_ya

A: But look: an л has crept in after the б, and only here, in люблю́.
    show l_ya_l

    hide l_ya_l

    show l_ya

B: Ты говори́шь, ты лю́бишь; он говори́т, она́ лю́бит.
    draw g_ty l_ty g_on l_on

A: Then мы, from lesson twenty-two. Мы говори́м is new, and so is мы лю́бим, with им.
    draw g_my l_my

B: And вы говори́те, вы лю́бите. Then two more new ones, for они́: они́ говоря́т, они́ лю́бят.
    draw g_vy l_vy g_oni l_oni

    erase gov_col

    draw chit_col parallel true

A: Lesson twenty-two's verbs had е: ты чита́ешь. These have и: ты лю́бишь, and ят, not ют, for они́.
    highlight c_ty l_ty c_oni l_oni color #c9871a effect underline

    erase chit_col lub_col pron_col

B: Смотре́ть, to watch, works the same way: я смотрю́ фильм, I'm watching a film.
    draw tv d_ya

A: Фильм is new, and like суп it stays as it is.
    highlight d_ya color #c9871a part фильм effect underline

B: To a friend, with ишь: ты смо́тришь фильм?
    draw d_ty

    erase pageD

B: Now hear it all in a chat: Tom is at my place tonight, and we talk about what we love.
    draw speakers

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, что ты смо́тришь?","gloss":"Masha, what are you watching?"},{"by":"b","text":"Фильм. Я люблю́ фи́льмы!","gloss":"A film. I love films!"},{"by":"a","text":"А я люблю́ ко́фе и Москву́.","gloss":"And I love coffee and Moscow."}] size 1.4

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    dialogue talk2 speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"b","text":"Ты лю́бишь чай?","gloss":"Do you love tea?"},{"by":"a","text":"Чай? Мне нра́вится.","gloss":"Tea? I like it."},{"by":"b","text":"А я не люблю́ чай. Я люблю́ молоко́!","gloss":"Well, I don't love tea. I love milk!"}] size 1.4

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

A: Tea only pleases me, so мне нра́вится; coffee and Moscow I love.
    highlight talk2_2_words color #c9871a part нра́вится effect underline

    erase talk2

    hide speakers

    icon q_tom size 120 set twemoji x 400 y 560 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man
    icon q_coffee size 120 set twemoji x 600 y 560 or ["coffee"] icon_look picture of "hot beverage"
    parallel true

    quiz "Masha tells you about Tom: Том … ко́фе. Which form fills the gap?" store q1 reveal.text "Том лю́бит ко́фе." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 360 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Tom is a he, so it takes the он ending, ит.
        wrong: Tom is он: take the он row, the ending ит.
        * люблю́
        * лю́бишь
        + лю́бит

    erase q_tom q_coffee q1_stamp

    icon q_mum size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["old woman","grandma"] icon_look picture of "older woman"

    ask "Say I love mum: Я люблю́ … Type ма́ма with the object ending." answer ["ма́му","маму"] store q2 default маму reveal.text "Я люблю́ ма́му." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 360 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Mum is loved, so ма́ма takes the object ending: ма́му.
        wrong: As in я ви́жу ма́му: the а at the end turns into у.

    erase q_mum q2_stamp

    icon q_tv size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["clapper board","film frames"] icon_look picture of television

    quiz "Tom and Masha say it together: Мы … фильм. Which form fills the gap?" store q3 reveal.text "Мы смо́трим фильм." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 360 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: For мы the ending is им, as in мы лю́бим.
        wrong: Мы takes им, as in мы лю́бим.
        * смо́трят
        + смо́трим
        * смотрю́

    erase q_tv q3_stamp

    icon q_tea size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["hot beverage"] icon_look picture of "teacup without handle"

    quiz "Which one says I love tea?" store q4 reveal.text "Я люблю́ чай." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 360 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: With люблю́ I do the loving, and it's stronger than нра́вится.
        wrong: Хочу́ is want, and нра́вится only pleases.
        * Я хочу́ чай.
        * Мне нра́вится чай.
        + Я люблю́ чай.

    erase q_tea q4_stamp

    icon q_heart size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["heart"] icon_look picture of "red heart"

    ask "For они́: они́ лю́б… Type the two letters of the ending." answer ["ят","любят","лю́бят"] store q5 default ят reveal.text "они́ лю́бят" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 360 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Они́ лю́бят: ят, as in они́ говоря́т.
        wrong: This family has ят for они́, not lesson twenty-two's ют.

    erase q_heart q5_stamp

    show pron_col lub_col

    move pron_col by [100,0] duration 0.01

    move lub_col by [-180,0] duration 0.01

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

B: So люблю́ is I love: you do the loving, what you love takes the object ending, and the endings are говори́ть's.
    highlight lub_col color #c9871a effect box

    erase lub_col pron_col

B: And what do I love? Я люблю́ молоко́ и ко́шку! Пока́!
    icon end_milk size 130 set twemoji x 400 y 520 or ["milk"] icon_look picture of "glass of milk"
    icon end_cat size 130 set twemoji x 600 y 520 or ["cat face"] icon_look picture of cat
    text end_line "Я люблю́ молоко́ и ко́шку!" #3d3833 say "Я люблю молоко и кошку!" say_voice b x 500 y 330 font_size 72

